### Eliminar un conductor que tiene viajes (400)
# ------------------------------- BAJA -------------------------------
DELETE {{url}}/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Eliminar un conductor sin viajes (200)
DELETE {{url}}/conductores/4
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Eliminar el mismo conductor otra vez (404)
DELETE {{url}}/conductores/4
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Eliminar con id no numerico (400)
DELETE {{url}}/conductores/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Eliminar sin token (401)
DELETE {{url}}/conductores/3
